      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T17:25:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`stage2_leaf_mapping_allowed` doesn\u0027t always return false if we specify `force_pte\u003dtrue`. On level 3 we support the block mapping and `kvm_block_mapping_supported` returns true. This allows us to update the current PTE with the new owner id. The anchor is used to keep a reference when we broke an already existing mapping which we want to rebuild later on.",
      "parentUuid": "8252b4ab_5b01c978",
